# ── Personal profile (intentionally NOT ignored) ────────────
# Profile.lua ships as an empty template and is REQUIRED for the addon
# to load (it is listed in the .toc), so it stays tracked. If you would
# rather keep your own `/md export` out of the repo, uncomment the line
# below AND keep a committed template (e.g. Profile.lua.example), or the
# addon will fail to load for anyone who clones it.
# Profile.lua
